      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.2,
          "end": 3.6,
          "en": "So now I wanna make sure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.6,
          "end": 5.73,
          "en": "that we can view this place on the map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.73,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "by tapping this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 9.27,
          "en": "Now, the convenient thing is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.27,
          "end": 11.14,
          "en": "that we already got a map screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.14,
          "end": 14.56,
          "en": "which we can use to show a full screen map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.56,
          "end": 17.48,
          "en": "We will just have to tweak this screen a little bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.48,
          "end": 20.2,
          "en": "to all the work with a pre-configured place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.2,
          "end": 23.9,
          "en": "because at the moment it always opens the map in same region",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.9,
          "end": 27.64,
          "en": "and it doesn't focus a specific place out of the box",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.64,
          "end": 29.36,
          "en": "when it opens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.36,
          "end": 32.5,
          "en": "So we'll have to change this, but as a first step here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.5,
          "end": 35.88,
          "en": "in PlaceDetails in our showOnMapHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.88,
          "end": 38.73,
          "en": "we can of course, open that map screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.73,
          "end": 43.73,
          "en": "by using our navigation prop and then the navigate method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.1,
          "end": 47.51,
          "en": "And then by opening the map screen like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.51,
          "end": 50.09,
          "en": "That is all we need to do initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.09,
          "end": 53.69,
          "en": "With this, if we click this button, the map opens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.69,
          "end": 56.76,
          "en": "But again, it doesn't focus any specific place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.76,
          "end": 59.2,
          "en": "In addition, it also shows the save icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.2,
          "end": 62.91,
          "en": "And of course, when viewing a place that we already created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.91,
          "end": 66.48,
          "en": "since I don't wanna allow users change that place here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.48,
          "end": 68.27,
          "en": "we shouldn't be able to save it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.27,
          "end": 69.95,
          "en": "I just shouldn't be able to view it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.95,
          "end": 72.68,
          "en": "but there shouldn't be any save button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.68,
          "end": 75.11,
          "en": "Therefore, we now wanna make this map screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.11,
          "end": 77.21000000000001,
          "en": "a bit more configurable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.21000000000001,
          "end": 80.45,
          "en": "We wanna make sure that we can set an initial place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.45,
          "end": 84.74,
          "en": "and that we can also hide the save button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.74,
          "end": 87.3,
          "en": "if we do have a place in view mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.3,
          "end": 89.75,
          "en": "so if we're just viewing a place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.75,
          "end": 93.223,
          "en": "Well, this can be implemented in a relatively easy way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.25,
          "end": 97.22999999999999,
          "en": "Here in the map screen, we can accept the route prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.22999999999999,
          "end": 100,
          "en": "which is provided by react navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100,
          "end": 102.91,
          "en": "And then we could set up some initialLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.91,
          "end": 104.283,
          "en": "which could be an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 106.71000000000001,
          "en": "Where we set the latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.71000000000001,
          "end": 111.71000000000001,
          "en": "equal to route.params.initialLat, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.22999999999999,
          "end": 116.05,
          "en": "And the longitude to route.params.initiallng.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.81,
          "end": 120.643,
          "en": "Now, for this of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.643,
          "end": 122.72,
          "en": "we assume that we get some route params",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.72,
          "end": 124.55,
          "en": "which will not always be the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.55,
          "end": 126.17,
          "en": "It will only be the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.17,
          "end": 129.543,
          "en": "if we're opening this map from the PlaceDetails screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.44,
          "end": 134.07,
          "en": "Therefore I will check if route params is truthy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.07,
          "end": 136.74,
          "en": "and only set this object to these values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.74,
          "end": 140.43,
          "en": "which we then know will be there if we do have route params.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.43,
          "end": 142.773,
          "en": "Otherwise initialLocation will be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.639,
          "end": 146.03,
          "en": "And therefore we can also use an alternative approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.03,
          "end": 148.41,
          "en": "and use the and operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.41,
          "end": 151.97,
          "en": "to only set the initialLocation to this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.97,
          "end": 153.95,
          "en": "if route params is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.95,
          "end": 156.21,
          "en": "Otherwise it will be set to undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.21,
          "end": 159.063,
          "en": "because otherwise route params will be undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.09,
          "end": 162.29,
          "en": "And then we can use this initialLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.29,
          "end": 164.25,
          "en": "for our region here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.25,
          "end": 167,
          "en": "We have these standard starting coordinates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167,
          "end": 171.02,
          "en": "but I wanna override them if we already have a location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.02,
          "end": 173.84,
          "en": "So can check if initialLocation is truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.84,
          "end": 175.5,
          "en": "so if it's not undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.5,
          "end": 178.81,
          "en": "which it only will be if we have route params.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.81,
          "end": 182.59,
          "en": "And if it is truthy, we can set initialLocation.lat",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.59,
          "end": 186.38,
          "en": "as a value here and otherwise use our default latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186.38,
          "end": 189.147,
          "en": "if we don't have an initialLocation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190,
          "end": 193.11,
          "en": "And we do the same here for the longitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 193.11,
          "end": 194.823,
          "en": "just with .lng.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.4,
          "end": 198.997,
          "en": "So with that, we can set an initialLocation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 198.997,
          "end": 201.59,
          "en": "Off course, also wanna show a marker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 201.59,
          "end": 203.67000000000002,
          "en": "if we have an initialLocation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 203.67000000000002,
          "end": 207.637,
          "en": "because then the marker should be at that initialLocation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.59,
          "end": 210.6,
          "en": "Now, this marker will be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 210.6,
          "end": 213.1,
          "en": "whenever we have a selected location,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.1,
          "end": 216.22,
          "en": "and selected location is our state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216.22,
          "end": 219.38,
          "en": "But default, selected location is undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 219.38,
          "end": 221.25,
          "en": "but we can change this now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.25,
          "end": 223.06,
          "en": "We can get our initialLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 223.06,
          "end": 224.97,
          "en": "before we initialize the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 224.97,
          "end": 227.924,
          "en": "and we can then use our initialLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.924,
          "end": 228.757,
          "en": "as the initial state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.72,
          "end": 234.3,
          "en": "So my initialLocation can be used as the initial state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 234.3,
          "end": 236.24,
          "en": "And that is either undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 236.24,
          "end": 238.61,
          "en": "which is the same as we had before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 238.61,
          "end": 242.77,
          "en": "Or it is an object of this shape which then is an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 242.77,
          "end": 246.433,
          "en": "that can be used down there to show a marker, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 251.29,
          "en": "So when we add a place that should still work as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 251.29,
          "end": 253.67,
          "en": "but we should now also be able to view this map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 253.67,
          "end": 255.88,
          "en": "with an initialLocation selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 255.88,
          "end": 259.27,
          "en": "if we have an initialLocation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 259.27,
          "end": 261.38,
          "en": "I also wanna hide this save button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 261.38,
          "end": 263.52,
          "en": "if I have an initialLocation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.52,
          "end": 266.17,
          "en": "And therefore in useLayoutEffect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 266.17,
          "end": 268.9,
          "en": "where I'm adding this save button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 268.9,
          "end": 273.09000000000003,
          "en": "I simply wanna check if we have a initialLocation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 273.09000000000003,
          "end": 274.55,
          "en": "if this is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 274.55,
          "end": 277.67,
          "en": "In which case I will return and do nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 277.67,
          "end": 281.36,
          "en": "So this code will not be executed then if I return here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.36,
          "end": 285.4,
          "en": "So this acts as a guard where this code won't be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 285.4,
          "end": 287.39,
          "en": "if we have an initialLocation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 287.39,
          "end": 290.17,
          "en": "because then we know that we're in view mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 290.17,
          "end": 292.93,
          "en": "in read-only mode so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 292.93,
          "end": 296.08,
          "en": "and we won't be able to change the location anyways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 296.08,
          "end": 298.293,
          "en": "hence this header button shouldn't be shown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.46,
          "end": 301.26,
          "en": "Therefore of course, initialLocation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 301.26,
          "end": 304.383,
          "en": "should technically also be added as a dependency here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 305.64,
          "end": 310.64,
          "en": "Okay, so now with all of that, we updated the map screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.35,
          "end": 313.21,
          "en": "This should work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 313.21,
          "end": 316.75,
          "en": "Now, we have to make sure that we set this initialLocation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 316.75,
          "end": 319.8,
          "en": "so that we set these route parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 319.8,
          "end": 323.38,
          "en": "the initiallat and initiallng route parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 323.38,
          "end": 326.223,
          "en": "when we go to this map in read-only mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 327.28,
          "end": 328.82,
          "en": "So in PlaceDetails,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 328.82,
          "end": 332.55,
          "en": "which is the place where I wanna open the map in that mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 332.55,
          "end": 335.72,
          "en": "we can pass our route parameters to navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 335.72,
          "end": 340.72,
          "en": "and set the initiallat and the initiallng values here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 341.59000000000003,
          "end": 343.01,
          "en": "And initiallat off course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 343.01,
          "end": 347.937,
          "en": "should be our fetchedPlace.location.lat.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 349.40999999999997,
          "end": 354.40999999999997,
          "en": "And the longitude should be fetchedPlace.location.lng.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 358.76,
          "end": 361.34,
          "en": "And with that, if we reload again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 361.34,
          "end": 365.53,
          "en": "we should still be able to open this map here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 365.53,
          "end": 366.88,
          "en": "when we add a place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 366.88,
          "end": 370.31,
          "en": "and we can still pick a place and save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 370.31,
          "end": 372.47,
          "en": "so that works as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 372.47,
          "end": 375.97,
          "en": "But if I open it from the PlaceDetails screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 375.97,
          "end": 379.21,
          "en": "then I get an error fetchedPlace.location.lat",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 379.21,
          "end": 382.16,
          "en": "is not found here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 382.16,
          "end": 384.61,
          "en": "And this error makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 384.61,
          "end": 387.14300000000003,
          "en": "because we have one problem in our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 387.98,
          "end": 390.16,
          "en": "When we're fetching the PlaceDetails,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 390.16,
          "end": 391.53,
          "en": "I am returning the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 391.53,
          "end": 393.88,
          "en": "as we're getting it back from the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 393.88,
          "end": 395.53,
          "en": "Now, we must keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 395.53,
          "end": 398.67,
          "en": "that this place as it's coming back from the database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 398.67,
          "end": 400.983,
          "en": "doesn't have the shape of our place model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
